{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>下午2時許，警方接獲途人報案，一名男子在將軍澳上村一個修車場被私家車壓住，救援人員接報趕至，男子昏迷送往將軍澳醫院。警方正調查事故原因。據現場消息，男事主修理一輛私家車期間，車身突然塌下壓住男事主。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T09:15:30.644175+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T08:46:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T09:09:02.171337+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T09:09:02.171337+00:00","content_hash":"c80dabfc7c3dd68785a99986959aedd776e599682fcc0edfa66324ce1466ff18","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}